    "source_change_classification_details": {
      "common/jinja/caps.cpp": "Produces chat_template_caps values consumed by the adapter text-only guard. v0.2.0 adds reasoning-effort detection and refines string/typed-content analysis; v0.4.1 adds a string-versus-array check for templates that branch on content type. These flags are template-dependent; Swallowtail does not add reasoning or typed-content capability.",
      "common/jinja/caps.h": "Adds the upstream supports_reasoning_effort member and helper declaration. The selected Rust property struct has no such field and serde ignores additive unknown fields; existing text-only fields remain consumed.",
      "common/build-info.h": "Changes the declaration of llama_print_build_info, while llama_build_info remains the selected build_info accessor. Runtime point derivation remains the separate b{build}-{commit} formatter in common/build-info.cpp.in and CMake.",
      "tools/server/server-models.cpp": "Contains router-mode /props and /v1/models handlers. Router additions and model loading/management remain outside the attached contract. The adapter requires the selected build/template properties and exactly one catalogue id, so router responses lacking those fields or listing multiple models fail closed. v0.6.0 adds /v1/models architecture metadata; serde ignores additive fields while id/object and one-model checks remain.",
      "tools/server/server-models.h": "Declares the router handlers and model-manager state used by server-models.cpp; new model routing and management declarations are outside the attached facade. The selected handler outputs are classified with server-models.cpp."
    },
